    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 2 CP, used as the opposing player's Fight phase ends. Choose one of your DAEMONETTES units that is outside Engagement Range of every enemy unit; lift it off the battlefield and set it into Strategic Reserves. Should it return by Deep Strike during your following Movement phase's Reinforcements step, it may be set up anywhere more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy unit (rather than more than 8\"), provided that it is placed entirely within 8\" of at least one EMPEROR'S CHILDREN unit of yours.",
